{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206250","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1120625001:1":{"text":"おーい、みなさん、こっちでゆっくり休みましょうよ！","source_cn":"嘿，两位，快来好好休息一会儿吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C17AA2A65DD340D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120625002:1":{"text":"何の話ですか？","source_cn":"你们刚才说什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4791E34FCD1C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1120625002":{"text":"何の話ですか？","source_cn":"你们刚才说什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4791E34FCD1C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120625003:1":{"text":"大事な話……みなさんはトレジャーハンターですよね？大事な話というのはもしかして……","source_cn":"重要的事……你们几个，是宝藏猎人吧？那说的难道是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CB24728E8D372C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120625004:1":{"text":"ああ。宝がある方角とその周りの状況について確認していたんだ。","source_cn":"是的，除了确定行进方向，我们还重新评估了藏宝点的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2D7D1CA6CE0387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120625005:1":{"text":"確認は終わった。間違いなくスゴい財宝だ！もしかすると本当に二十頭の鋼顎獣いっぱいの財宝を持って故郷に帰れるかもしれない。","source_cn":"已经确认了，那绝对是非常丰厚的宝藏！我们或许真的需要二...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x489EF9D21E3CA5F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120625006:1":{"text":"二十頭の鋼顎獣でようやく運べるだけの財宝！？","source_cn":"二十只钢颚兽才能搬走的宝藏？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B22999CDC7AFEE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120625007:1":{"text":"それはスゴい話だ！やったぞー！いやいや、本当にみなさんが羨ましいですよ！","source_cn":"那真是令人惊喜的发现！真是太好了！不，我是说，真羡慕你们啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90EBB51A195B2C67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120625008:1":{"text":"君、もう十分休んだだろう？そろそろ出発しよう。","source_cn":"朋友，休息够了吗？该出发了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x910A06D214A6CBF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120625009:1":{"text":"僕ですか？もちろん！もちろんです……もう元気モリモリです！","source_cn":"我？当然，当然……我现在精神焕发！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E0E8A355E08F2AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120625010:1":{"text":"いざ、行かん！財宝に向かって！友情に向かって！そして希望に向かって！","source_cn":"前行，